    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d332">

                <pb facs="0470" n="448" sameAs="frus:frus1951v02/pg448"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">320/1–2852: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Chairman of the United States Delegation to
                        the General Assembly</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Roosevelt</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">niact</hi>
                        
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1952-01-28T22:00:00+01:00">January 28,
                            1952—10 p.m</date>.<lb/>[Received January 28—4:28 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    Delga 1234. Re: Membership. Replies Gadel 852. Para 1: Negative. FYI today Gross obtained seven LA commitments to switch from abstentions to vote
                    against Sov res in plenary.</p>
                <p>Para 2: Plenary Feb 1 or 2 and SC probably few
                    days later.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Roosevelt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
